  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 200 °C. Lay the apricot halves cut-side up in a baking dish, drizzle with oil and honey, season with salt and scatter over the thyme.",
    "Bake 15 minutes until soft and lightly caramelised.",
    "Meanwhile, mix the shallot with the vinegar and leave to pickle for 15 minutes.",
    "Tear the burrata over a plate, top with the warm apricots and their juices, the pickled shallots and pine nuts.",
    "Season and serve straight away with crusty bread."
